WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:23.675
A named deputy may still be unable to take over. Repairing the agreement is not enough; the arrangement must work when someone is absent. You may have passed a task to a colleague and assumed it was covered. Without usable access, open-action details and explicit acceptance, the work can remain unowned. We will trace a complete handover and its separate service interfaces.
